Dear all,

=20

I attach Day 5 of the public record series =E2=80=94 The Perjury on the Face of t=
he Sworn Record.

=20

This is the fifth instalment in the serialised public record I have been di=
stributing since 20 April 2026. The previous instalments are available in th=
e public archive at https://github.com/nadiazahmoul/Zahmoul-v-SSJ-HMCTS-Publ=
ic-Archive.

=20

Today's statement places on the public record a documentary contradiction b=
etween (a) a sworn statement made by Mr Karim Zahmoul before the Family Divi=
sion of the High Court on 19 February 2024 valuing his 50,000 Oxus Acquisiti=
on Corp Founder Shares at $0, and (b) a Definitive Proxy Statement filed wit=
h the United States Securities and Exchange Commission thirty-four days earl=
ier, signed by him as Director, recording those same 50,000 shares at a mark=
et value of approximately $565,000.

=20

A separate formal request to the Commissioner of the Metropolitan Police Se=
rvice is sent by parallel email of today's date.

=20

With kind wishes,

=20

Nadia Zahmoul

Litigant in Person | BV20D01752 | Veritas Numquam Perit

=20

Attachments:
Day5 Public Record 19May2026
Day5 Exhibit 34DaySequence 19May2026
SEC Filings Excerpts CIK1852973
Day5 Exhibit 6March2024 Email to Judge
D11 Application Notice OXUS False Representations 7March2024
Approved Transcript 8May2025 Judgment
=20

=20

